# Contract JSON under scripts/ is byte-pinned evidence: its readers hash the
# file's exact bytes (CONTRACT_SHA256 in the *_native.py modules, contractSha256
# in the MemoryPack audit) and fail closed on any mismatch. 217 of these files
# are CRLF on disk and three are deliberately mixed, so git must never convert
# their line endings -- `eol=lf` here would rewrite them on checkout and break
# every pin with no other symptom. `-text` disables all EOL conversion.
scripts/**/*.json -text
